To run the project locally without Xampp or other tings

Open the terminal inside the IDE or Vscode
type:
        php -s localhost:8000
and go to the htpp address of the development server
for example: 
PS C:\Users\user\Documents\GitHub\CCT> php -S localhost:8000
[Wed Aug 20 22:12:06 2025] PHP 8.4.11 Development Server (http://localhost:8000) started

this is usually a good sign that the php is already running

